#!/usr/bin/env briar
# Ramus

A library one directory down; its `via` climbs with `..`, resolved
against THIS file's directory, never the current one.

<bibliotheca via="../folium.thistle"/>

<c!>
s32
ramus_octuplicare (s32 x)
{
    redde folium_duplicare(folium_duplicare(folium_duplicare(x)));
}
</c>
